>(TT;I)TT;␀>([TE;)␀>([TT;)V␀>([TT;)[TT;␀>([TT;I␀	>([TT;I)V␀>([TT;I)[TT;␀>([TT;IITT;)[TT;␀>([TT;ITT;)[TT;␀>([TT;IZ␀>, but returned null␀>.Force␀>;␀>;)␀>;)I␀>;)TT;␀>;)V␀>;)Z␀>;)[␀>;)[B␀>;)[I␀>;>(TY;)TY;␀>;>;␀>;>;)␀>;>;)I␀>;>;)V␀>;>;)Z␀>;>;>;␀>;>;>;)␀>;>;>;)V␀>;>;>;>;␀>;C[F)V␀>;F)V␀>;F)Z␀>;I␀>;I)␀>;I)I␀>;I)V␀>;IFF)V␀>;II␀>;II)␀>;II)V␀>;II)Z␀>;IIZ␀>;IIZ)V␀>;IJ)␀>;IJ)V␀>;IZ)␀>;I[B)V␀>;J␀>;JJ)[J␀
