ent.␀TCreate a new marker with default properties at the specified latitude and longitude.␀mCreate a new space component dynamically. Use for width/height '-1' for wrap content or '-2' for fill parent.␀'Create a new user by Email and Password␀-Create a zip file with or without a password.␀บCreate the Confirm Credentials screen. You can customize the title and description. Or we will provide a generic one for you if you leave it empty. Works only for devices with Android 5+␀"CreateApplicationSpecificDirectory␀CreateButton␀CreateCardView␀CreateCustomDialog␀CreateDirectory␀CreateImage␀CreateLabel␀CreateLayout␀CreateMarker␀	CreateRow␀CreateSearchablePdf␀CreateShortcut␀CreateSpace␀CreateTextBox␀CreateWebView␀Create_List␀Create_Search␀Created␀
