The value of this property will then be set to the list of direct messages retrieved (and maintain that value until any subsequent call to <code>RequestDirectMessages</code>).␀๖This property contains the 20 most recent messages of users being followed.  Initially, the list is empty.  To set it, the program must: <ol> <li> Call the <code>Authorize</code> method.</li> <li> Wait for the <code>IsAuthorized</code> event.</li> <li> Specify users to follow with one or more calls to the <code>Follow</code> method.</li> <li> Call the <code>RequestFriendTimeline</code> method.</li> <li> Wait for the <code>FriendTimelineReceived</code> event.</li> </ol>
