ns of a multi-screen app. </p> <p>When you are developing apps using the AI Companion, all the apps using that companion will share the same TinyDb.  That sharing will disappear once the apps are packaged.  But, during development, you should be careful to clear the TinyDb each time you start working on a new app.</p>␀TinyDB1␀TinyDb␀	TinyWebDB␀Tiny_DB1␀Tiramisu␀TiramisuImpl␀Title␀/Title Style - BOLD, BOLD ITALIC, ITALIC, NORMAL␀"Title of the page currently viewed␀Title text is: ␀TitleBarColor␀TitleBarFontTypeface␀TitleBarIconSelected␀TitleBarSubTitle␀TitleBarTypefaceImport␀	TitleBold␀
