UrlToShort␀'Usage:  [java] kawa.Telnet HOST [PORT#]␀,Usage: [java kawa.repl | kawa] [options ...]␀+Use <format> when printing top-level output␀Use C.CLEARKEY_UUID instead␀.Use ImmutableList.of or another implementation␀5Use MediaContent provided by NativeAd.getMediaContent␀Use a 'Material' icon for the fab without uploading a image resource into your project. You can find the icon name here at https://material.io/resources/icons␀?Use codes instead of strings in returns for ScanMode and State.␀9Use this block after LoadNetworkAd to show the loaded ad.␀:Use this block after LoadRewardedAd to show the loaded ad.␀GUse this block after loading an ad to check whether it's ready to show.␀Use this block to add a menu item with the given title and page link. The page can be as example 'https://www.instagram.com/kodular/'. If the user have Instagram installed,the page will then be opened in the official Instagram app. Else in the default browser.␀Use this block to add a menu item with the given title to open any app you want with the package name. The package name can be as example 'com.instagram.android' to open Instagram on the menu item click. If the app is not installed the menu item will not be added.␀3Use this block to apply a notification badge count.␀FUse this block to dismiss the created custom dialog.the custom dialog.␀DUse this block to install a flexible update after it was downloaded.␀$Use this block to load a Network ad.␀+Use this block to load a Rewarded Video ad.␀Use this block to lock the side menu. This means the user can not open the side menu until the side menu  unlock block is used.␀&Use this block to open the custom tab.␀NUse this block to pause the sound recorder. Works only on Android 6 and above.␀[Use this block to remove a polyline from the map. It will return true if it was successful.␀6Use this block to remove the notification badge count.␀OUse this block to resume the sound recorder. Works only on Android 6 and above.␀0Use this block to return the notification count.␀AUse this block to show the spotlight on a floating action button.␀%Use this block to show the spotlight.␀+Use this block to start the sound recorder.␀*Use this block to stop the sound recorder.␀@Use this block to test the youtube player. Powered by Kodular.io␀]Use this block to unlock the side menu. This means the user can now open again the side menu.␀ทUse this block together with the 'Youtube Player' Initialized event. Loads and automatically plays the specified youtube video. Use only as example '_bZj-LOXdH8' from a youtube video.␀ชUse this component to translate words and sentences between different languages. This component needs Internet access, as it will request translations to the Yandex.Translate service. Specify the source and target language in the form source-target using two letter language codes. So"en-es" will translate from English to Spanish while "es-ru" will translate from Spanish to Russian. If you leave out the source language, the service will attempt to detect the source language. So providing just "es" will attempt to detect the source language and translate it to Spanish.<p /> This component is powered by the Yandex translation service.  See http://api.yandex.com/translate/ for more information, including the list of available languages and the meanings of the language codes and status codes. <p />Note: Translation happens asynchronously in the background. When the translation is complete, the "GotTranslation" event is triggered.␀IUse this event to check if the app is ready to request the user to review␀UUse this event to check if updates from Google Play Store are available for your app.␀กUse this event to detect that the playback quality was changed. Return values: 'UNKNOWN', 'SMALL', 'MEDIUM', 'LARGE', 'HD720', 'HD1080', 'HIGH_RES' or 'DEFAULT'.␀‘Use this event to detect that the playback rate was changed. Return values: 'UNKNOWN', 'RATE_0_25', 'RATE_0_5', 'RATE_1', 'RATE_1_5' or 'RATE_2'.␀’Use this event to detect that the state changes. Return values: 'UNKNOWN', 'UNSTARTED', 'ENDED', 'PLAYING', 'PAUSED', 'BUFFERING' or 'VIDEO_CUED'.␀๐Use this event to detect that there was any error with the player. Return values: 'UNKNOWN', 'INVALID_PARAMETER_IN_REQUEST', 'HTML_5_PLAYER', 'VIDEO_NOT_FOUND', 'VIDEO_NOT_PLAYABLE_IN_EMBEDDED_PLAYER', 'INVALID_VOLUME' or 'INVALID_SEEK_TO'.␀oUse this event to know when the review popup was closed (this triggers always, even if the user did not review)␀IUse this event to start the playing of a normal or instant youtube video.␀^Use this function if you try to create a image view flipper. Please use a 'make a list' block.␀Use this function if you try to create a image view flipper. Use images separated by commas such as: Image1.png,Image2.png,Image3.png.␀UseAnimation␀UseBackCamera␀UseBackgroundColor␀UseCodes␀UseCredentials␀	UseDialog␀UseExperimental.kt␀UseExternalBrowser␀UseExternalScanner␀UseFront␀UseGPS␀	UseLegacy␀	UsePrompt␀UseRoundCard␀UseSSL␀UseServiceAuthentication␀UseWideViewPort␀ÛUsed to drop / delete table from database. Please note that this event will DELETE any data you may have on the table and will then delete table from the database. After this operation is completed, it cannot be undone!␀:Used to retrieve list of existing tables from the database␀DUsed to run any valid SQLite query and return results in same block.␀User␀User Interface␀"User clicked on the action button.␀ User failed to choose an account␀%User failed to create a valid account␀>User has changed the map bounds by panning or zooming the map.␀+User has changed the zoom level of the map.␀8User has no more validity, need to renew. User name is: ␀User held the button down.␀"User is in locked direct boot mode␀#User is not in list. User name is: ␀User is null or empty.␀$User needs to (re)enter credentials.␀User opened a notification.␀User received a notification.␀User signed in.␀User signed out.␀$User tapped and released the button.␀*Us